      "body": "## Background\n\n`torch.nonzero()` forces an expensive CPU-GPU synchronization on CUDA tensors because it needs to allocate an output tensor of indeterminate size. This causes unnecessary stalls, especially in multi-modal VLM preprocessing and attention backend paths.\n\n## Problem\n\nMultiple places in the runtime codebase use `.nonzero()` where the more efficient `nonzero(as_tuple=True)` form would suffice without triggering the same overhead.\n\n## Solution\n\nReplace `.nonzero()` with `.nonzero(as_tuple=True)`:\n- 1D masks: `mask.nonzero(as_tuple=True)[0]` instead of `mask.nonzero().flatten()` or `.squeeze(1)`\n- 2D masks: `mask.nonzero(as_tuple=True)[dim]` instead of `mask.nonzero()[:, dim]`\n\nFiles changed:\n1. `python/sglang/srt/configs/janus_pro.py` - `image_token_mask.nonzero()` → `nonzero(as_tuple=True)[0]`\n2. `python/sglang/srt/models/phi4mm_utils.py` - `nonzero()[:, 1]` → `nonzero(as_tuple=True)[1]`\n3. `python/sglang/srt/multimodal/processors/moss_vl.py` - `nonzero()` → `nonzero(as_tuple=True)` tuple with unpacking\n4. `python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/qwen_sparse_attn_backend.py` - `nonzero().flatten()` → `nonzero(as_tuple=True)[0]`\n5. `python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/dsv4/v41_indexer/scoring.py` - `nonzero().squeeze(1)` → `nonzero(as_tuple=True)[0]`\n6. `python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/deepseek_v4_backend.py` - `nonzero().squeeze(1)` → `nonzero(as_tuple=True)[0]`\n\n## Testing\n\n- All 6 modified files pass Python AST syntax validation\n- Semantically equivalent: `nonzero(as_tuple=True)[i]` produces identical values to `nonzero()[:, i]`\n\nCloses #9889\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38556822712](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38556822712)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38556822639](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38556822639)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38556822684](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38556822684)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
